{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing API represents network collections as `network-set`, while containment is already strict and family-aware. I’ll define intersection as the narrower `IPNetwork` when CIDRs overlap, otherwise `nil`; subtraction will return a `network-set`, with IPv4/IPv6 mismatches treated as disjoint. I’m adding focused tests for those semantics before implementation."}}
